<div>
    <p>
        This plugin provides the classic <b>Freestyle project</b> job type, letting you configure
        a build by combining any number of source code management (SCM) systems, build triggers,
        build steps, and post-build actions — all through the standard job configuration UI rather
        than a pipeline script.
    </p>
